        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is the strongest Gu Master in Hua Feng City, skilled in both the pen and the sword: good at fighting and at refining Gu. The contest starts with him in the lead, and by the middle he has left Fang Zheng in the dust. Even hairy men from both Steel Thread City and Hua Feng City do not think Fang Zheng can win. Following Fang Yuan’s will, Fang Zheng still surpasses him and wins. Mao Shi Ba cannot accept the result and stares blankly.",
      "chapters": [
        1050
      ],
